2004-09-30 andrewg

	* packages/acs-lang/tcl/localization-data-init.tcl:
	* packages/acs-lang/tcl/localization-procs.tcl:
	An attempt to speed up the lc_time_fmt call, which gets hit 
	10+ times per page in calendar applications.  We're now 
	memoizing the compilation of % codes to tcl procs and vars.  
	Also, we're no longer rebuilding the hash array of percent 
	codes each time, instead using a namespace var that gets 
	initialized in localization-data-init.tcl 

