2004-02-04 bdolicki

	* packages/acs-core-docs/www/files/note-procs.tcl:
	* packages/acs-core-docs/www/xml/developers-guide/tutorial-pages.xml:
	Fixed a bug: we used to prefetch item_id, which gets 
	discarded and then grab a new one in the proc.  Now we are 
	relying on the caller to provide item_id prefetched on the 
	form.  (This of course sucks donkeyballs but at least it is 
	not broken now).  Also using a character entity instead of $ 
	in $Id: ChangeLog,v 1.13.4.2 2013/08/30 08:18:29 gustafn Exp $ to prevent keyword expansion.  Plus, I added usage 
	of the -message flag on the ad_returnedirect. 

