2003-10-09 frankn

	* packages/acs-subsite/www/admin/site-map/instance-delete.tcl:
	This fixes a problem with deleting an unmounted package 
	instance. If you added and mounted, say, a subsite instance, 
	unmounted and then attempted to delete it through 
	sitemap->Manage unmounted applications, you would get an 
	error. It seems site_node::get_node_id_from_object_id 
	doesn't even fail for an unmounted package, returning the 
	empty string in this case, and the catch test doesn't trip. 
	Now we explicitly test for the node_id being set to a 
	sensible value. 

