	* packages/acs-tcl/tcl/00-database-procs.tcl:
	1. Added -unclobber switch to db_multirow. 2. Added 
	peek-ahead to db_multirow, which enables you to do something 
	similar to the templating system's <group> tag when building 
	up a multirow. See documentation to    
	db_multirow_group_last_row_p for details. 3. Untabified the 
	whole buffer, which, unfortunately, makes the concrete 
	changes I've made totally obscure. Sorry. 

