	fixing some code that used to be legal but as of PG 7.3 is 
	not.  You can no longer subtract an integer from a timestamp 
	but must cast to date, "timestamp" disappeared (must use 
	"interval" now), "datetime" disappeared ("timestamptz"), and 
	suchwhat.  Not done but closer than it was before ... 

