2003-01-02 lars

	* packages/acs-admin/tcl/apm-admin-procs.tcl:
	* packages/acs-admin/www/apm/packages-install-2.tcl:
	* packages/acs-admin/www/apm/packages-install.tcl:
	* packages/acs-tcl/tcl/apm-install-procs.tcl:
	APM enhancement: If a package you want to install requires 
	another package that isn't installed nor selected, it simply 
	adds the required package to the list of packages to 
	install. That way you don't have to go back and forth 
	between the two package installation screens when you want 
	to install a package, the APM does it for you. 

