2002-11-12 lars

	* packages/acs-tcl/tcl/utilities-procs.tcl:
	Replaced &amp; with & in export_entire_form_as_url_vars. The 
	&amp; expansion really should be done with ad_quotehtml by 
	the templating system before spitting out the HTML, not 
	here. It causes other trouble, e.g. double-escaping of & as 
	in &amp;amp;, which causes the URL to not work correctly. 

