2002-09-04 lars

	* packages/acs-tcl/tcl/text-html-procs.tcl:
	Fixed problem introduced by Arjun's change of tab 
	processing: Tab characters was part of Branimir's sTaRtUrL 
	hack. Since the tabs got replaced with spaces, the 
	sTaRtUrL/eNdUrL things didn't get replaced back. I've moved 
	the tab expansion to the end of the proc, and that takes 
	care of the problem. In addition, I've added quotes, single 
	and double, to the list of characters that we strip from the 
	end of a URL. 

