	are now installed during the initial bootstrap install    of 
	the system.  2. Fixed a dupe query name problem in a couple 
	of queryfiles.  The problem    is not with the dispatcher 
	but with the extractor, and for the moment it    is just 
	easier to kludge the resulting queryfile than fix the 
	extractor. 

